  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFA REFERENCE: HQ-PSU-2024-OSCE MOLDOVA OSCE REFERENCE:  3100361</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ending trafficking in human beings and gender-based violence across both banks of the Dniester/Nistru River project in Moldova, implemented by the OSCE, aims to combat gender-based violence and trafficking in human beings in Moldova, including on the left bank. The objective of the grant is to provide core funding to support the implementation of the project. Key activities include awareness raising on the issue of domestic violence, supporting survivors of human trafficking, particularly children, and supporting the development of comprehensive Anti-Trafficking measures across the justice system.</narrative>
  </description>
